@page "/page-b"
@rendermode @(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))

@* Interactive Server with prerender:false and NO PageTitle -> an SSRRenderModeBoundary that
   emits no page markup on the static pass. That is dump 2's tree exactly: root + HeadOutlet
   (+ its two SectionOutlets and their content renderers, one disposed) + router/layout chrome
   + the boundary, with only the layout's PageTitle. *@
<h1>Page B</h1>
<p>Interactive Server, prerender:false, no PageTitle.</p>
